<BugInfo xmlns="http://www.codesafe.cn/schema/rules" id="0402000010110004" language="Java">
			<Type>bug</Type>
			<Categories>
				<Category type="ClassChin">GB/T 34944-2017</Category>
				<Category type="SubClassChin">代码质量</Category>
				<Category type="DetailClassChin">Cookie：未经过SSL加密</Category>
			</Categories>
			<BugServerity>2</BugServerity>
			<DynamicDescription><![CDATA[<p th:if="${funcNameisEmpty}" th:text="在+'`'+${fileName}+'`'+的+'`'+${funcName}+'`'+方法中的第+'`'+${line}+'`'+行中Cookie未经过SSL加密。" th:remove="tag"></p>
<p th:unless="${funcNameisEmpty}" th:text="在+'`'+${fileName}+'`'+的第+'`'+${line}+'`'+行中Cookie未经过SSL加密。" th:remove="tag"></p>]]></DynamicDescription>
			<Description><![CDATA[使用未加密的网络传输通道发送Cookie易受到网络截取攻击。创建Cookie时，需要将secure标记设置为true，表明浏览器必须通过HTTPS来加密传输Cookie。  
  
**例如**：下面代码片段中，将Cookie添加到HTTP响应中时，未设置secure标记。  
```java
...  
Cookie cookie = new Cookie("SessionID", sessionID);  
response.addCookie(cookie);  
...
```
]]></Description>
			<Advice><![CDATA[为Cookie添加secure标记，要求浏览器通过HTTPS发送Cookie，这样有助于保护Cookie值的保密性。
]]></Advice>
			<References>
				<Reference type="CWE">614:Sensitive Cookie in HTTPS Session Without 'Secure' Attribute</Reference>
				<Reference type="OWASP TOP 10">2017:A3 Sensitive Data Exposure</Reference>
				<Reference type="OWASP TOP 10">2013:A6 Sensitive Data Exposure</Reference>
				<Reference type="OWASP TOP 10">2010:A9 Insufficient Transport Layer Protection</Reference>
				<Reference type="OWASP TOP 10">2007:A9 Insecure Communications</Reference>
				<Reference type="OWASP TOP 10">2004:A10 Insecure Configuration Management</Reference>
				<Reference type="GB/T 34944-2017 Java">安全功能:HTTPS会话中的敏感cookie没有设置安全属性</Reference>
			</References>
			<Obsolete>not</Obsolete>
			<Default>yes</Default>
			<WhiteList>not</WhiteList>
			<Security>yes</Security>



			<Tag>security</Tag>
			<DomainType>security</DomainType>
		</BugInfo>
		